<!-- "Altyazıyı göster: TV / Bilgisayar ekranı / İkisi de / Yalnız OBS (yayın)" ve bilgisayar ekranındaki pencerenin seçenekleri (Mac: SubtitleOutputCard.swift).
     Ana ekranda ve ayarlarda aynı kart kullanılır. -->
<UserControl x:Class="CouchSubs.App.Views.SubtitleOutputCard"
             xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
             xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
             xmlns:c="clr-namespace:CouchSubs.App.Controls"
             xmlns:t="clr-namespace:CouchSubs.App.Theme"
             xmlns:local="clr-namespace:CouchSubs.App.Views">
    <!-- Mac OutputSettings: kart başlığı "Altyazıyı göster", kısa etiketli seçici (TV / Bu bilgisayar / İkisi de / OBS), anlamı
         altındaki cümlede. OBS adresleri kopyala simgesi kutunun içinde olan tam yuvarlak kutularda (CopyField). -->
    <c:Card Title="{t:T 'Show subtitles on'}">
        <c:SpacedStack>
            <StackPanel>
                <Border Style="{StaticResource SegmentGroup}" HorizontalAlignment="Stretch">
                    <UniformGrid Rows="1">
                        <RadioButton x:Name="OutputTv" Content="TV" GroupName="subtitleOutput" Style="{StaticResource SegmentButton}" Checked="OnOutput" Tag="Tv" />
                        <RadioButton x:Name="OutputComputer" Content="{t:T 'This computer'}" GroupName="subtitleOutput" Style="{StaticResource SegmentButton}" Checked="OnOutput" Tag="Computer" />
                        <RadioButton x:Name="OutputBoth" Content="{t:T 'Both'}" GroupName="subtitleOutput" Style="{StaticResource SegmentButton}" Checked="OnOutput" Tag="Both" />
                        <RadioButton x:Name="OutputObs" Content="OBS" GroupName="subtitleOutput" Style="{StaticResource SegmentButton}" Checked="OnOutput" Tag="Obs" />
                    </UniformGrid>
                </Border>
                <TextBlock x:Name="OutputHint" Style="{StaticResource HintText}" Margin="{t:Sp '0,unitHint,0,0'}" />
            </StackPanel>
            <!-- "Yalnız OBS (yayın)": TV aranmaz, bilgisayar ekranında pencere açılmaz; altyazı yalnız OBS katmanına gider (Mac ile aynı). -->
            <c:SpacedStack x:Name="ObsPanel" Gap="s">
                <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HintText}"
                           Text="{t:T 'Subtitles go only to the OBS overlay. The TV is not searched for or opened, and no subtitle window opens on this computer. In OBS add a Browser source with this address (width 1920, height 1080).'}" />
                <c:CopyField x:Name="OutputObsAddress" />
                <c:SpacedStack x:Name="OutputNetworkObsPanel" Gap="s">
                    <TextBlock Style="{StaticResource HintText}" Text="{t:T 'If OBS runs on another computer, use this address:'}" />
                    <c:CopyField x:Name="OutputNetworkObsAddress" />
                </c:SpacedStack>
            </c:SpacedStack>
            <c:SpacedStack x:Name="ComputerPanel">
                <c:Unit Title="{t:T 'Computer screen'}">
                    <StackPanel>
                        <TextBlock x:Name="WindowHint" Style="{StaticResource HintText}" Margin="{t:Sp '0,0,0,s'}"
                                   Text="{t:T 'Subtitles appear in a window on this computer, over the game or PS Remote Play.'}" />
                        <Button x:Name="Adjust" Content="{t:T 'Position the subtitles'}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Click="OnAdjust" />
                    </StackPanel>
                </c:Unit>
                <StackPanel>
                    <c:SwitchRow x:Name="ClickThrough" Content="{t:T 'Clicks pass through'}" Checked="OnClickThrough" Unchecked="OnClickThrough" />
                    <TextBlock x:Name="ClickThroughHint" Style="{StaticResource HintText}" Margin="{t:Sp 'xxl,unitHint,0,0'}" />
                </StackPanel>
            </c:SpacedStack>
            <!-- Ana ekranda: altyazıyı ayrıca bir telefon ya da tablet tarayıcısında göstermek (Ayarlar'da ayrı kart). -->
            <StackPanel x:Name="SecondScreenEntry">
                <Button x:Name="SecondScreenButton" Content="{t:T 'Show on another device'}" HorizontalAlignment="Left" Click="OnSecondScreen" />
                <Popup x:Name="SecondScreenPopup" PlacementTarget="{Binding ElementName=SecondScreenButton}" Placement="Bottom"
                       StaysOpen="False" AllowsTransparency="True" PopupAnimation="Fade">
                    <Border Background="{DynamicResource surfaceBrush}" BorderBrush="{DynamicResource borderBrush}" BorderThickness="1"
                            CornerRadius="{DynamicResource radius.tile}" Padding="{t:Sp 'l'}" Width="380" Margin="{t:Sp '0,xs,0,0'}">
                        <StackPanel>
                            <TextBlock Text="{t:T 'Show on another device'}" Style="{StaticResource CardTitleText}" Margin="{t:Sp '0,0,0,l'}" />
                            <local:SecondScreenPanel x:Name="SecondScreenView" />
                        </StackPanel>
                    </Border>
                </Popup>
            </StackPanel>
        </c:SpacedStack>
    </c:Card>
</UserControl>
